1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,371
这是一个训练 run，跑完了，一个报错都没有
Here is a training run that finished without a single error.

2
00:00:03,691 --> 00:00:07,467
任务成功了，这个 run 也在 Weights & Biases 里
The job succeeded, and the run exists in Weights & Biases.

3
00:00:07,787 --> 00:00:10,709
它的 config 在，系统图表也在
Its config is there, and so are its system charts.

4
00:00:11,683 --> 00:00:14,798
但是没有 loss 图，也没有准确率图
But there is no loss chart, and no accuracy chart.

5
00:00:15,118 --> 00:00:16,561
曲线去哪了？
Where are the curves?

6
00:00:16,611 --> 00:00:18,830
这是训练这个模型的那一行代码
Here is the line that trained this model.

7
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:22,073
先记着，过几分钟我们再回来
Hold that thought; we come back to it in a few minutes.

8
00:00:22,317 --> 00:00:26,776
角落里的灰色标签，标出每个想法背后的课件
The gray tag in the corner names the lecture slides behind each idea.

9
00:00:27,096 --> 00:00:30,937
在课上的路线图里，实验追踪很早就搭好
On the lecture's roadmap, experiment tracking is set up early,

10
00:00:30,937 --> 00:00:34,839
和基线模型一起，紧跟在数据收集之后
together with the baseline models, right after data collection.

11
00:00:35,083 --> 00:00:38,176
这是第 13 讲的考前版
This is the exam edition of Lecture 13.

12
00:00:38,496 --> 00:00:42,870
它沿着训练工作流悄悄出错的五个地方走一遍
It follows five places where a training workflow quietly breaks:

13
00:00:42,870 --> 00:00:47,585
run 的记录、包、GPU、batch，还有任务本身
the run record, the package, the GPUs, the batch, and the job itself.

14
00:00:47,833 --> 00:00:51,972
每一部分都以一条规则收尾：题目说这个，就想那个
Each part ends with one rule: if the question says this, think that.

15
00:00:52,292 --> 00:00:55,662
有三次，屏幕上会出现一道小测风格的题
Three times, a quiz-style question appears on screen.

16
00:00:55,982 --> 00:00:59,993
先暂停，选一个答案，再听每个错误选项错在哪
Pause, pick an answer, and then hear why each wrong option is wrong.

17
00:01:00,367 --> 00:01:03,034
课上讲了到底为什么要追踪
The lecture names the reason to track at all.

18
00:01:03,354 --> 00:01:09,241
题目说实验追踪，就想：这个结果是怎么来的，我能不能重复出来？
If the question says experiment tracking, think: what produced this result, and can I repeat it?

19
00:01:11,583 --> 00:01:13,247
一个 run 的记录应该装些什么？
What should a run record hold?

20
00:01:13,567 --> 00:01:15,475
课上列了七样
The lecture lists seven things:

21
00:01:15,475 --> 00:01:21,076
环境、代码、数据、模型、指标、产物，还有你的笔记
the environment, the code, the data, the model, the metrics, the artifacts, and your notes.

22
00:01:21,550 --> 00:01:23,470
其中大部分已经有地方放了
Most of these already have a home.

23
00:01:23,790 --> 00:01:27,107
代码在 GitHub，数据在版本管理系统里
Code lives in GitHub, data in a versioning system,

24
00:01:27,107 --> 00:01:31,086
环境在 pyproject 文件和 lock 文件里
and the environment in the pyproject file and the lock file.

25
00:01:31,406 --> 00:01:34,222
权重、指标和日志，先打个问号
Weights, metrics and logs get a question mark.

26
00:01:34,466 --> 00:01:36,059
关于数据，说一句
One word on data.

27
00:01:36,109 --> 00:01:40,043
数据版本是一对东西：bucket 里归档的快照
A data version is a pair: the archived snapshot in a bucket,

28
00:01:40,043 --> 00:01:44,173
加上给它命名的版本记录，两者靠内容哈希连起来
and the version record that names it, linked by a content hash.

29
00:01:44,493 --> 00:01:48,004
而这个训练脚本下载的是数据的一个固定版本
This trainer instead downloads a fixed release of the data,

30
00:01:48,004 --> 00:01:50,146
也从不把它写进 config
and never writes it into the config.

31
00:01:50,383 --> 00:01:55,780
手工记录总会忘，所以课上用 Weights & Biases 把它自动化
Recording by hand gets forgotten, so the lecture automates it with Weights & Biases.

32
00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:59,642
想象一个账本，每个训练 run 是其中一行
Picture a ledger in which every training run is one row.

33
00:01:59,883 --> 00:02:04,427
这个 repo 的训练脚本 task.py，用四个调用和这个账本打交道
The repo trainer, task.py, talks to that ledger in four calls.

34
00:02:04,747 --> 00:02:09,078
首先它用一个密钥登录，密钥作为命令行参数传入，从不写进代码
First it logs in with a key passed as a flag, never written in the code.

35
00:02:09,316 --> 00:02:14,381
然后 wandb.init 开一个新行，带上项目、名字和 config
Then wandb.init opens a new row, with a project, a name, and a config:

36
00:02:14,381 --> 00:02:17,999
学习率、epoch 数、batch 大小和模型名
learning rate, epochs, batch size, and model name.

37
00:02:18,319 --> 00:02:21,000
它还把这一行设成活跃的 run
It also makes that row the active run,

38
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:24,527
叫 wandb.run 的指针现在就指向它
and the pointer called wandb.run now points at it.

39
00:02:24,766 --> 00:02:29,651
训练结束后，脚本再加一个 config 值：执行时间
After training, the script adds one more config value, the execution time.

40
00:02:29,971 --> 00:02:35,156
然后 wandb.run.finish 把这一行封存，指针变回空
Then wandb.run.finish() seals the row, and the pointer falls back to nothing.

41
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:38,331
注意这个 run 自己记下了什么
Notice what this run recorded on its own:

42
00:02:38,331 --> 00:02:42,120
config，还有 CPU 和内存这样的系统图表
the config, and system charts such as CPU and memory.

43
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:44,083
它没有记录 loss
It did not record a loss.

44
00:02:44,403 --> 00:02:46,642
还得有个东西来记录指标
Something still has to log the metrics.

45
00:02:47,483 --> 00:02:50,325
题目说 run 的记录，就想
If the question says record of a run, think:

46
00:02:50,325 --> 00:02:54,523
init 开启它，logger 写入指标，finish 关闭它
init opens it, a logger writes the metrics, and finish closes it.

47
00:02:54,766 --> 00:02:56,188
第一题
First question.

48
00:02:56,238 --> 00:02:59,118
这个 run 显示了 config，却没有 loss 曲线
The run shows its config but no loss curve.

49
00:02:59,438 --> 00:03:01,465
哪个改动能让它出现 loss 曲线？
Which change puts a loss curve on it?

50
00:03:01,785 --> 00:03:05,198
有三个选项，用你已经知道的就能排除
Three options can be ruled out with what you know already.

51
00:03:05,518 --> 00:03:07,118
想停的话，就在这里暂停
Pause here if you want.

52
00:03:18,033 --> 00:03:22,741
答案是 C：在 fit 的 callbacks 里传入 WandbMetricsLogger
The answer is C: pass the WandbMetricsLogger in the callbacks of fit,

53
00:03:22,741 --> 00:03:24,341
并且要在 init 之后创建
created after init.

54
00:03:24,561 --> 00:03:26,822
A：名字只是给这一行贴个标签
A: a name only labels the row.

55
00:03:27,142 --> 00:03:31,132
B：config 里的一个数，不是跨 epoch 的历史
B: one number in the config is not a history over epochs.

56
00:03:31,452 --> 00:03:33,926
D：再登录一次，不会写入任何指标
D: logging in again writes no metrics.

57
00:03:34,166 --> 00:03:37,238
这个 callback 就是训练时 Keras 握在手里的一支笔
A callback is a pen that Keras holds during training.

58
00:03:37,558 --> 00:03:40,884
每个 epoch 结束时，它调用 wandb.log
At the end of every epoch it calls wandb.log,

59
00:03:40,884 --> 00:03:43,396
而这个调用写进 wandb.run
and that call writes to wandb.run:

60
00:03:43,396 --> 00:03:48,716
也就是此刻活跃的那一行，不是创建这支笔时的那个 run
whichever row is active right now, not the run the pen was created with.

61
00:03:48,950 --> 00:03:51,318
课上的 notebook 正是这么做的
The lecture's notebook does exactly this.

62
00:03:51,638 --> 00:03:53,354
它先调用 init，再调用 fit
It calls init, and then fit,

63
00:03:53,354 --> 00:03:56,480
callbacks 列表里放着 WandbCallback
with a callbacks list that holds the WandbCallback.

64
00:03:56,716 --> 00:03:59,788
默认情况下，每个 epoch 写一条历史记录
By default, that is one history entry per epoch.

65
00:04:00,108 --> 00:04:02,263
按 batch 记录，只有你要求才会发生
Per batch happens only if you ask.

66
00:04:02,816 --> 00:04:04,416
现在做四个实验
Now four experiments.

67
00:04:04,608 --> 00:04:06,115
第一个，没有笔
First, no pen.

68
00:04:06,165 --> 00:04:09,259
调用 fit 跑两个 epoch，记录栏一直空着
Fit runs two epochs, and the strip stays empty.

69
00:04:09,579 --> 00:04:11,179
这就是我们开头那个 run
That is our opening run.

70
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:13,495
第二个：init，fit 两个 epoch
Second: init, fit for two epochs,

71
00:04:13,495 --> 00:04:16,669
再 fit 四个，中间没有 finish
then fit for four more, with no finish in between.

72
00:04:16,989 --> 00:04:21,021
指针从没动过，所以第三到第六条落在同一行
The pointer never moved, so ticks three to six land on the same row.

73
00:04:21,341 --> 00:04:23,005
一个 run，六条记录
One run, six entries.

74
00:04:23,250 --> 00:04:26,480
第三个：第一次 fit 之后 finish，再 init 一次
Third: finish after the first fit, then init again,

75
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:29,202
用同一个 callback fit 四个 epoch
and fit four epochs with the same callback.

76
00:04:29,522 --> 00:04:31,762
第一行封存了，里面有两条记录
The first row is sealed with two entries.

77
00:04:32,082 --> 00:04:34,443
这个 callback 是在第一行时创建的
The callback was made during row one,

78
00:04:34,443 --> 00:04:38,780
但它跟着指针走，所以新的一行拿到第一到第四条
but it follows the pointer, so the new row gets entries one to four.

79
00:04:39,016 --> 00:04:42,195
第四个：先 finish，然后不重新 init 就再 fit 一次
Fourth: finish, then fit again without a new init.

80
00:04:42,515 --> 00:04:46,819
第一个 epoch 训练完，然后笔跟着指针指向空
The first epoch trains, and then the pen follows the pointer to nothing

81
00:04:46,819 --> 00:04:50,152
报错停下：你必须先调用 init，再 log
and stops with an error: you must call init before log.

82
00:04:50,472 --> 00:04:52,072
哪一行都没收到记录
Nothing reaches any row.

83
00:04:52,250 --> 00:04:55,663
没有活跃的 run 时创建这个 logger，会马上报错
Creating the logger with no active run fails at once.

84
00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:57,173
回到开头
Now the hook.

85
00:04:57,223 --> 00:04:59,971
这个 repo 的训练脚本导入了两个 callback
The repo trainer imports both callbacks

86
00:04:59,971 --> 00:05:01,591
却一个也没传给 fit
but passes none to fit,

87
00:05:01,591 --> 00:05:05,607
所以它的 run 有 config 和系统图表，却没有曲线
so its run has a config and system charts, and no curves.

88
00:05:05,927 --> 00:05:09,852
课上中间那一行，也就是 callback，正是缺的那一行
The lecture's middle line, the callback, is the line that is missing.

89
00:05:10,916 --> 00:05:15,673
有个细节：这个 notebook 会提示 WandbCallback 已经弃用
One detail: the notebook warns that the WandbCallback is deprecated.

90
00:05:15,993 --> 00:05:20,047
要画曲线，它的替代品是 WandbMetricsLogger
For the curves, its replacement is the WandbMetricsLogger.

91
00:05:20,283 --> 00:05:24,212
题目问有几条历史记录，就想：每个 epoch 一条
If the question counts history entries, think: one per epoch,

92
00:05:24,212 --> 00:05:27,238
写进 epoch 结束时开着的那个 run
into whichever run is open when the epoch ends.

93
00:05:27,558 --> 00:05:30,907
一次 finish 结束计数，一次新的 init 开始新的计数
A finish ends the count, and a new init starts a new one.

94
00:05:32,050 --> 00:05:35,899
课上分三步把训练从本地搬到云上
The lecture moves training to the cloud in three steps:

95
00:05:35,899 --> 00:05:39,538
一个带参数的 Python 文件、bucket 里的一个包
a Python file with arguments, a package in a bucket,

96
00:05:39,538 --> 00:05:41,778
以及 Vertex AI 上的一个训练任务
and a training job on Vertex AI.

97
00:05:42,017 --> 00:05:45,851
这是 package 目录：setup.py，还有一个 trainer 目录
Here is the package folder: setup.py, and a trainer folder

98
00:05:45,851 --> 00:05:49,355
里面是一个空的 init 文件和两个训练脚本
with an empty init file and the two training scripts.

99
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,627
这个 setup.py 里有两张清单
setup.py keeps two lists.

100
00:05:51,947 --> 00:05:57,824
其中 install requires 是一张购物清单，pip 从 PyPI 下载
install_requires is a shopping list that pip downloads from the Python Package Index;

101
00:05:57,824 --> 00:05:59,968
这里只有一个 pin 了版本的 wandb
here, one pinned wandb version.

102
00:06:00,288 --> 00:06:04,527
而 find packages 决定你自己的哪些目录会被安装
find_packages() decides which of your own folders get installed:

103
00:06:04,527 --> 00:06:06,581
只有带 init 文件的目录
only folders with an init file.

104
00:06:06,817 --> 00:06:09,517
打包脚本把 package 目录打成 tar 包
The packaging script tars the package folder,

105
00:06:09,517 --> 00:06:12,278
压缩，再复制到你的 bucket
compresses it, and copies it into your bucket.

106
00:06:12,598 --> 00:06:15,842
提交任务的脚本让 Vertex AI 指向这个文件
The job script points Vertex AI at that file

107
00:06:15,842 --> 00:06:18,422
并指定模块：trainer.task
and names the module: trainer.task.

108
00:06:18,667 --> 00:06:20,267
关键在这里
Here is the key fact.

109
00:06:20,352 --> 00:06:25,280
你自己的 Docker image 负责打包、上传和提交，但从不训练
Your own Docker image packages, uploads and submits, but it never trains.

110
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:28,525
任务跑在 Google 预构建的训练 image 里
The job runs in Google's prebuilt training image,

111
00:06:28,525 --> 00:06:31,509
你的代码只能通过 tar 包到达那里
and your code reaches it only through the tarball.

112
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:36,102
这个 image 已经自带 TensorFlow、scikit-learn 和 requests
That image already ships TensorFlow, scikit-learn and requests,

113
00:06:36,102 --> 00:06:40,454
所以训练脚本照样能 import 它们，虽然 setup.py 从没写过
so the trainer imports them although setup.py never names them.

114
00:06:40,700 --> 00:06:43,431
在跑任务的机器上，pip 把 tar 包解开
On the job machine, pip unwraps the tarball.

115
00:06:43,751 --> 00:06:47,953
购物清单拉来 wandb，trainer 包被安装好
The shopping list fetches wandb, and the trainer package is installed.

116
00:06:48,273 --> 00:06:51,516
然后 Vertex 运行：python -m trainer.task
Then Vertex runs python -m trainer.task.

117
00:06:51,750 --> 00:06:54,641
现在加一个队友写的模块 augment.py
Now add a teammate's module, augment.py,

118
00:06:54,641 --> 00:06:57,894
一个编出来的例子，放在 package 目录旁边
a made-up example, beside the package folder.

119
00:06:58,214 --> 00:07:02,630
脚本只打包那个目录，所以这个模块从没离开你的笔记本
The script tars only that folder, so the module never leaves your laptop.

120
00:07:02,950 --> 00:07:06,190
如果改放在 setup.py 旁边，它会跟着走
Placed next to setup.py instead, it travels,

121
00:07:06,190 --> 00:07:08,326
但 find packages 会跳过它
but find_packages() skips it.

122
00:07:09,067 --> 00:07:11,265
任务执行到 import augment
The task reaches import augment;

123
00:07:11,265 --> 00:07:14,699
Python 在导入路径里找，什么也没找到
Python searches its import path and finds nothing.

124
00:07:15,019 --> 00:07:20,374
ModuleNotFoundError，就在写着依赖全部装好的那一行下面
ModuleNotFoundError, right under the line that says every dependency installed.

125
00:07:20,694 --> 00:07:24,619
在本地它能跑，因为文件就在你运行命令的那个目录里
Locally it worked, because the file sat in the folder you ran from.

126
00:07:24,867 --> 00:07:29,944
修法：把文件放进 trainer 目录，或者在 setup.py 里列出来
The fix: put the file inside the trainer folder, or list it in setup.py.

127
00:07:30,264 --> 00:07:34,296
只加一行 import 什么也带不过去；文件得跟着走
A new import line alone moves nothing; the file has to travel.

128
00:07:34,533 --> 00:07:36,944
把它加到 install requires 里是错的
Adding it to install_requires is wrong.

129
00:07:37,264 --> 00:07:41,707
那张清单从 PyPI 下载，绝不会从你的 tar 包里拿
That list downloads from the Python Package Index, never from your tarball,

130
00:07:41,707 --> 00:07:45,499
而那里同名的包，会是别人的代码
and a package there with that name would be someone else's code.

131
00:07:45,733 --> 00:07:51,105
题目说依赖都装好了却报 ModuleNotFoundError，就想
If the question says dependencies installed but ModuleNotFoundError, think:

132
00:07:51,105 --> 00:07:55,760
这个文件没有跟着 setup.py 打的包一起走
the file never travelled inside the package that setup.py builds.

133
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:59,901
课上把训练硬件分成三种形态
The lecture sorts training hardware into three shapes.

134
00:08:00,221 --> 00:08:04,253
一台机器、一块 GPU，用 OneDeviceStrategy
One machine with one GPU uses OneDeviceStrategy.

135
00:08:04,573 --> 00:08:08,477
一台机器、多块 GPU，用 MirroredStrategy
One machine with several GPUs uses MirroredStrategy.

136
00:08:08,797 --> 00:08:12,253
多台机器，用 MultiWorkerMirroredStrategy
Several machines use MultiWorkerMirroredStrategy.

137
00:08:12,500 --> 00:08:14,463
这个 repo 在中间那一行
The repo sits on the middle row.

138
00:08:14,783 --> 00:08:19,824
它的多 GPU 脚本向 Vertex AI 要一台机器
Its multi GPU script asks Vertex AI for one machine,

139
00:08:19,824 --> 00:08:23,508
机型 n1-standard-32，带两块 T4 GPU
type n1-standard-32, with two T4 GPUs.

140
00:08:23,828 --> 00:08:26,729
那里的副本数为 1，意思是一台机器
A replica count of one there means one machine.

141
00:08:26,967 --> 00:08:32,571
训练脚本创建 MirroredStrategy，再问有多少个副本在同步
The trainer creates the MirroredStrategy and asks how many replicas are in sync:

142
00:08:32,571 --> 00:08:34,171
每块 GPU 一个，所以是两个
one per GPU, so two.

143
00:08:34,391 --> 00:08:38,965
然后它在 strategy.scope 里构建并编译模型
Then it builds and compiles the model inside strategy.scope(),

144
00:08:38,965 --> 00:08:44,055
所以每个权重和优化器变量都被复制，每块 GPU 一份
so every weight and optimizer variable is mirrored, one copy per GPU.

145
00:08:44,300 --> 00:08:45,900
这是一个训练步
Here is one training step.

146
00:08:46,220 --> 00:08:50,679
每块 GPU 拿自己那一份 batch，算出一个梯度
Each GPU takes its own slice of the batch and computes a gradient.

147
00:08:50,999 --> 00:08:54,079
这些梯度在 all-reduce 里汇合、取平均
The gradients meet in an all-reduce and are averaged,

148
00:08:54,079 --> 00:08:56,695
同一份更新再发回两份拷贝
and the same update goes back to both copies.

149
00:08:56,933 --> 00:09:00,425
现在换成两台机器，每台跑自己的 MirroredStrategy
Now two machines, each running its own MirroredStrategy

150
00:09:00,425 --> 00:09:02,266
用的是自己那份数据分片
on its own shard of the data.

151
00:09:02,586 --> 00:09:07,408
每台机器内部，环是通的，但两台机器之间没有连线
Inside each machine the ring works, but between the machines there is no wire.

152
00:09:07,728 --> 00:09:12,101
几步之后，它们的权重就不一样了：是两个独立的模型，不是一个
After a few steps they hold different weights: two separate models, not one.

153
00:09:12,350 --> 00:09:17,001
要跨机器训练一个模型，用 MultiWorkerMirroredStrategy
To train one model across machines, use MultiWorkerMirroredStrategy.

154
00:09:17,321 --> 00:09:19,428
每台机器读取一份 TF config
Each machine reads a TF_CONFIG:

155
00:09:19,428 --> 00:09:23,507
所有 worker 的列表，以及它自己在列表里的索引
the list of all the workers, and its own index in that list.

156
00:09:23,827 --> 00:09:29,843
分片和之前一样；唯一的变化是这根连线，现在每份拷贝都保持一致
Same shards as before; the only change is the wire, and now every copy stays the same.

157
00:09:31,450 --> 00:09:33,204
这个 repo 没用它
The repo does not use it;

158
00:09:33,204 --> 00:09:37,765
在 Vertex AI 上多出来的机器会放进第二个 worker pool
on Vertex AI the extra machines would go in a second worker pool,

159
00:09:37,765 --> 00:09:40,431
Vertex 会替你设好 TF config
and Vertex sets the TF_CONFIG for you.

160
00:09:40,751 --> 00:09:43,869
还有一个命名陷阱：repo 和课上一样
One naming trap: the repo, like the lecture,

161
00:09:43,869 --> 00:09:48,901
把副本数叫作 num workers，但它数的是一台机器上的 GPU
calls its replica count num_workers, but it counts GPUs on one machine.

162
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:53,101
题目说多台机器必须训练同一个模型，就想
If the question says several machines must train one model,

163
00:09:53,101 --> 00:09:56,382
MultiWorkerMirroredStrategy 加 TF config
think MultiWorkerMirroredStrategy with TF_CONFIG.

164
00:09:56,702 --> 00:09:59,902
MirroredStrategy 从不越过自己这台机器
A MirroredStrategy never looks past its own machine.

165
00:10:01,150 --> 00:10:02,487
再看 batch
Now the batch.

166
00:10:02,537 --> 00:10:07,383
在策略下，dataset.batch 产出的就是全局 batch
Under a strategy, whatever dataset.batch produces is the global batch,

167
00:10:07,383 --> 00:10:09,321
也就是一步用的整个托盘
the whole tray for one step.

168
00:10:09,641 --> 00:10:13,907
策略把这个托盘切成相等的几份，每个副本一份
The strategy cuts that tray into equal slices, one per replica.

169
00:10:15,017 --> 00:10:20,500
所以每个副本的 batch 等于全局 batch 除以同步的副本数
So the per replica batch is the global batch divided by the number of replicas in sync.

170
00:10:20,820 --> 00:10:25,875
反过来，全局 batch 就是每个副本的 batch 乘以副本数
Turn it around, and the global batch is the per replica batch times the replicas.

171
00:10:26,117 --> 00:10:29,893
假设有 8 个副本，你想让每个副本拿到 16 个样本
Take 8 replicas, and say you want 16 examples on each.

172
00:10:30,213 --> 00:10:33,498
按 16 分 batch，每块 GPU 只拿到 2 个
Batch by 16, and each GPU gets only 2.

173
00:10:33,818 --> 00:10:35,610
按 128 分 batch
Batch by 128.

174
00:10:35,930 --> 00:10:37,722
每块 GPU 拿到 16 个
Each GPU gets 16.

175
00:10:38,567 --> 00:10:41,127
这个 repo 做的是同样的乘法
The repo does the same multiplication.

176
00:10:41,447 --> 00:10:45,504
它拿 batch 大小参数乘以副本数
It takes the batch size flag, multiplies it by the replica count,

177
00:10:45,504 --> 00:10:48,188
再把乘积交给数据 pipeline
and hands the product to the data pipeline.

178
00:10:48,508 --> 00:10:52,305
它自己的注释就写着：batch 期望的是全局 batch 大小
Its own comment says it: batch expects the global batch size.

179
00:10:53,550 --> 00:10:55,057
第二题
Second question.

180
00:10:55,107 --> 00:10:59,390
这个 repo 的多 GPU 训练脚本现在跑在 4 块 GPU 上
The repo's multi GPU trainer now runs on 4 GPUs,

181
00:10:59,390 --> 00:11:01,977
batch 大小参数是 32
with a batch size flag of 32.

182
00:11:02,297 --> 00:11:06,030
全局 batch 是多少，每块 GPU 每一步看到多少？
What is the global batch, and what does each GPU see per step?

183
00:11:06,350 --> 00:11:07,950
想停的话，就在这里暂停
Pause here if you want.

184
00:11:18,550 --> 00:11:20,121
答案是 B
The answer is B.

185
00:11:20,171 --> 00:11:29,260
训练脚本先做乘法：32 乘 4 等于 128，策略再把 128 分成四份
The trainer multiplies first: 32 times 4 is 128, and the strategy splits 128 four ways,

186
00:11:29,260 --> 00:11:31,350
所以每块 GPU 看到 32 个
so each GPU sees 32.

187
00:11:31,670 --> 00:11:34,273
A：这是一个从没做乘法的脚本
A: that is a script that never multiplied.

188
00:11:34,593 --> 00:11:38,625
C：这个参数是每个副本的大小，不是全局 batch
C: the flag is the per replica size, not the global batch.

189
00:11:38,945 --> 00:11:42,998
D：全局 batch 是被切分的，不是复制给每块 GPU
D: the global batch is split, not copied to every GPU.

190
00:11:43,733 --> 00:11:47,584
题目说每个副本，就先乘再分 batch
If the question says per replica, multiply before you batch:

191
00:11:47,584 --> 00:11:51,499
全局 batch 等于每个副本的 batch 乘以副本数
the global batch is the per replica batch times the replicas.

192
00:11:52,633 --> 00:11:54,183
最后一个机制
Last mechanism.

193
00:11:54,233 --> 00:11:58,222
假设一个网页应用有个重新训练的按钮，训练要一个小时
Suppose a web app has a retrain button, and training takes an hour.

194
00:11:58,542 --> 00:12:00,142
这一个小时应该在哪里跑？
Where should that hour run?

195
00:12:00,216 --> 00:12:03,779
每一段工作，都只活得和承载它的东西一样久
Every piece of work lives as long as the thing that holds it.

196
00:12:04,099 --> 00:12:07,875
放在请求处理函数里，它会在请求超时的时候死掉
Inside the request handler, it dies at the request timeout.

197
00:12:08,116 --> 00:12:12,303
放在服务器线程里，它只能活到这个服务器实例结束
In a server thread, it lives only as long as that server instance,

198
00:12:12,303 --> 00:12:15,220
而平台想什么时候回收它就什么时候回收
which the platform recycles whenever it likes.

199
00:12:15,466 --> 00:12:18,389
把客户端超时调长，调的是错的那个时钟
A longer client timeout moves the wrong clock.

200
00:12:18,709 --> 00:12:21,901
服务器和代理照样会切断请求
The server and the proxies still cut the request,

201
00:12:21,901 --> 00:12:24,896
而休眠的笔记本无论如何都会丢掉结果
and a sleeping laptop loses the answer anyway.

202
00:12:25,133 --> 00:12:31,405
而 W&B 根本不是时钟：它记录 run，但没有执行它们的引擎
And W&B is not a clock at all: it logs runs, but has no engine to execute them.

203
00:12:31,650 --> 00:12:37,154
正确的设计：处理函数提交一个持久的任务，马上返回它的 ID
The right design: the handler submits a durable job and returns its id at once.

204
00:12:37,474 --> 00:12:41,838
任务依次经过 QUEUED、PENDING、RUNNING、SUCCEEDED
The job moves through its states, queued, pending, running, succeeded,

205
00:12:41,838 --> 00:12:44,706
在自己的机器上，只在运行时计费
on its own machine, billed only while it runs.

206
00:12:45,026 --> 00:12:48,332
有项目权限的任何人都可以轮询这个 ID
Anyone with access to the project can poll the id.

207
00:12:51,233 --> 00:12:53,824
这就是课上讲的无服务器训练
That is the lecture's serverless training:

208
00:12:53,824 --> 00:12:58,017
硬件只为训练这一步租用，也没有服务器要管
hardware rented only for the training step, and no server to manage.

209
00:12:58,337 --> 00:13:01,686
机器还是有的；只是它的生命周期不归你管
There is still a machine; you just do not own its lifetime.

210
00:13:01,933 --> 00:13:04,668
在 repo 里，这张工单就是一条命令
In the repo, the ticket is one command,

211
00:13:04,668 --> 00:13:06,701
gcloud ai custom-jobs create
gcloud ai custom-jobs create,

212
00:13:06,701 --> 00:13:11,468
再带上区域、名字和 bucket 里的包，以及一个 worker pool
with a region, a name, the package in the bucket, and a worker pool:

213
00:13:11,468 --> 00:13:15,394
机器类型、副本数、预构建的 image 和模块
machine type, replica count, prebuilt image, and module.

214
00:13:16,233 --> 00:13:17,655
第三题
Third question.

215
00:13:17,705 --> 00:13:21,673
你的自定义任务显示 RUNNING，你合上笔记本过夜
Your custom job shows running, and you close the laptop for the night.

216
00:13:21,993 --> 00:13:23,593
训练会怎样？
What happens to the training?

217
00:13:23,870 --> 00:13:25,470
想停的话，就在这里暂停
Pause here if you want.

218
00:13:36,083 --> 00:13:41,096
答案是 B：它在自己的机器上一直跑，直到完成或失败
The answer is B: it keeps running on its own machine until it finishes or fails.

219
00:13:41,416 --> 00:13:44,360
A：CLI container 只负责提交
A: the CLI container only submitted it.

220
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:48,350
C：W&B 只做记录；它从不驱动训练
C: W&B only logs; it never drives training.

221
00:13:48,670 --> 00:13:51,720
D：你的笔记本上不保存任务的状态
D: nothing on your laptop holds the job's state.

222
00:13:52,466 --> 00:13:56,868
题目说训练要跑得比请求还久，就想
If the question says training takes longer than the request, think:

223
00:13:56,868 --> 00:13:59,890
提交一个持久的任务，返回它的 ID，然后轮询
submit a durable job, return its id, and poll.

224
00:14:00,210 --> 00:14:02,152
W&B 只是旁观
W&B only watches.

225
00:14:03,300 --> 00:14:04,900
周二要记住的六条规则
Six rules for Tuesday.

226
00:14:05,220 --> 00:14:09,994
第一条：callback 每个 epoch 往活跃的 run 里记一条
Rule one: a callback logs one entry per epoch into the active run;

227
00:14:09,994 --> 00:14:12,815
init 开启 run，finish 关闭它
init opens a run, and finish closes it.

228
00:14:13,050 --> 00:14:16,850
第二条：pip 只安装 setup.py 声明的东西
Rule two: pip installs only what setup.py declares;

229
00:14:16,850 --> 00:14:23,034
你自己的模块必须在它打出的包里，而不只是在 tar 包里
your own modules must be inside the package it builds, not just inside the tarball.

230
00:14:23,283 --> 00:14:27,863
第三条：MirroredStrategy 管一台机器的 GPU
Rule three: a MirroredStrategy covers the GPUs of one machine;

231
00:14:27,863 --> 00:14:32,591
跨机器，用 MultiWorkerMirroredStrategy 加 TF config
across machines, use MultiWorkerMirroredStrategy with TF_CONFIG,

232
00:14:32,591 --> 00:14:36,211
因为独立的策略训出独立的模型
because separate strategies make separate models.

233
00:14:36,450 --> 00:14:41,770
第四条：在策略下，dataset.batch 产出的是全局 batch
Rule four: under a strategy, what dataset.batch makes is the global batch,

234
00:14:41,770 --> 00:14:44,215
切分给同步的各个副本
split across the replicas in sync.

235
00:14:44,450 --> 00:14:48,718
第五条：长时间训练要交给一个有 ID 的持久任务
Rule five: long training goes to a durable job with an id,

236
00:14:48,718 --> 00:14:53,133
绝不放进请求处理函数、线程，或者更长的超时
never into a request handler, a thread, or a longer timeout.

237
00:14:53,367 --> 00:14:59,063
第六条：数据版本，就是归档的快照，加上指向它的记录
Rule six: a data version is an archived snapshot plus the record that points at it.

238
00:14:59,300 --> 00:15:03,070
课上一开始讲了让深度学习变好的三个杠杆
The lecture began with three levers for better deep learning:

239
00:15:03,070 --> 00:15:05,913
更多数据、更好的模型、更快的硬件
more data, better models, and faster hardware.

240
00:15:06,233 --> 00:15:10,671
今天讲的是硬件这个杠杆，外加能看出它有没有用的记账
Today was the hardware lever, plus the bookkeeping that shows whether it helped.

241
00:15:10,991 --> 00:15:12,591
祝你周二考试顺利
Good luck on Tuesday.
